Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 21:53:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 144/161] feat: Make target marker display again when loaded

* Fix new game causing no audio until game was paused and unpaused, I had it fixed for when it started but not on new games.

* Update changelog.
---
 Changelog.md                       | 11 +++++++
 src/core/Frontend.cpp              | 29 ++++++++++++++++--
 src/extras/utils/fast_loader.cpp   |  7 +++--
 src/extras/utils/fast_loader.h     |  3 +-
 src/extras/utils/freeroam_util.cpp | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 5 files changed, 87 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Changelog.md b/Changelog.md
index a74fa8eb..00efc698 100644
--- a/Changelog.md
+++ b/Changelog.md
@@ -788,8 +788,19 @@ feat: Add frontend-guides for modifying the menus
 
 ### 1.2.13-11a
 
+**Commit 1**
+
 feat: Make target marker get saved to the save file
 
 * Now the target marker position will get saved to the custom json file.
 
 * Update changelog, change version to 1.2.13-11a.
+
+**Commit 2**
+
+feat: Make target marker display again when loaded
+
+* Fix new game causing no audio until game was paused and unpaused, I had it fixed for when it started but not on new games.
+
+* Update changelog.
+
